---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Vyroba Wood - Catálogo de Maderas">
  <main class="relative">
    
<!-- Hero Section -->
<section class="relative h-[819px] flex items-center justify-start overflow-hidden border-b border-surface-dim">
<div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
<img alt="Macro wood grain" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-90 grayscale brightness-75" data-alt="Extreme macro close-up of dark walnut wood grain with high contrast lighting, showing every fiber and pore with scientific precision" src="/images/stitch/stitch_7.jpg"/>
</div>
<div class="relative z-10 px-10 max-w-6xl">
<div class="bg-secondary px-4 py-1 inline-block mb-4">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-xs text-on-primary tracking-[0.3em] uppercase">Fase 01: Ingeniería</span>
</div>
<h1 class="font-cabinet font-black text-8xl md:text-[9rem] leading-[0.85] tracking-tighter text-white uppercase drop-">
                    PRECISION<br/>PROCESADO<br/>SOLUTIONS
                </h1>
<p class="mt-8 font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-surface-container-lowest max-w-md uppercase tracking-widest text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    A clinical approach to woodworking. Where natural growth meets 0.1mm tolerance thresholding.
                </p>
</div>
<!-- Spec Tag Overlay -->
<div class="absolute bottom-10 right-10 flex flex-col items-end gap-2">
<div class="border border-white/20 px-3 py-1 font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-white uppercase backdrop-blur-sm">Lat: 49.2827° N</div>
<div class="border border-white/20 px-3 py-1 font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-white uppercase backdrop-blur-sm">Long: 123.1207° W</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Catálogo de Madera Section -->
<section class="py-24 px-10 max-w-full mx-auto">
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-end mb-16 gap-8">
<div>
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-secondary font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-xs">El Archivo</span>
<h2 class="font-cabinet font-black text-6xl tracking-tight uppercase mt-2">Catálogo de Madera</h2>
</div>
<div class="max-w-md text-right">
<p class="font-satoshi text-outline text-sm leading-relaxed uppercase">Nuestra selección curada de madera, probada en integridad estructural y estabilidad dimensional en climas extremos.</p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Bento Grid Wood Samples -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-1">
<!-- Sample 1: Roble Blanco -->
<div class="group relative aspect-square bg-surface-container overflow-hidden cursor-crosshair border border-surface-dim">
<img alt="Roble Blanco Sample" class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500" data-alt="Top down studio shot of a perfectly square white oak wood sample board with clean straight grain and matte finish" src="/images/stitch/stitch_8.jpg"/>
<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-primary/90 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<h3 class="font-cabinet font-bold text-2xl text-white uppercase">Roble Blanco</h3>
<div class="w-10 h-[2px] bg-secondary mt-2"></div>
</div>
<div class="space-y-4">
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-on-primary-container uppercase tracking-widest">Densidad</span>
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-white text-sm">760 kg/m³</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-on-primary-container uppercase tracking-widest">Origen</span>
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-white text-sm">Cordillera de los Apalaches</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-on-primary-container uppercase tracking-widest">Uso</span>
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-white text-sm">Estructural / Exterior</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-primary uppercase tracking-tighter opacity-100 group-hover:opacity-0">01 / W.ROBLE</div>
</div>
<!-- Sample 2: American Nogal -->
<div class="group relative aspect-square bg-surface-container overflow-hidden cursor-crosshair border border-surface-dim">
<img alt="Nogal Sample" class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500" data-alt="Macro photo of dark American walnut wood square, deep rich brown tones with swirling grain patterns" src="/images/stitch/stitch_9.jpg"/>
<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-primary/90 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<h3 class="font-cabinet font-bold text-2xl text-white uppercase">Nogal</h3>
<div class="w-10 h-[2px] bg-secondary mt-2"></div>
</div>
<div class="space-y-4">
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-on-primary-container uppercase tracking-widest">Densidad</span>
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-white text-sm">640 kg/m³</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-on-primary-container uppercase tracking-widest">Origen</span>
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-white text-sm">Centro de EE. UU.</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-on-primary-container uppercase tracking-widest">Uso</span>
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-white text-sm">Ebanistería Fina</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-primary uppercase tracking-tighter opacity-100 group-hover:opacity-0">02 / NOGAL</div>
</div>
<!-- Sample 3: Hard Arce -->
<div class="group relative aspect-square bg-surface-container overflow-hidden cursor-crosshair border border-surface-dim">
<img alt="Arce Sample" class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500" data-alt="Very light cream hard maple wood sample, consistent grain, high key studio lighting" src="/images/stitch/stitch_10.jpg"/>
<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-primary/90 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<h3 class="font-cabinet font-bold text-2xl text-white uppercase">Arce</h3>
<div class="w-10 h-[2px] bg-secondary mt-2"></div>
</div>
<div class="space-y-4">
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-on-primary-container uppercase tracking-widest">Densidad</span>
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-white text-sm">740 kg/m³</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-on-primary-container uppercase tracking-widest">Origen</span>
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-white text-sm">Bosques del Norte</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-on-primary-container uppercase tracking-widest">Uso</span>
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-white text-sm">Carpintería / Suelos</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-primary uppercase tracking-tighter opacity-100 group-hover:opacity-0">03 / ARCE</div>
</div>
<!-- Sample 4: Ash -->
<div class="group relative aspect-square bg-surface-container overflow-hidden cursor-crosshair border border-surface-dim">
<img alt="Ash Sample" class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500" data-alt="Ash wood specimen with prominent wide grain, light tan color, industrial aesthetic" src="/images/stitch/stitch_11.jpg"/>
<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-primary/90 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<h3 class="font-cabinet font-bold text-2xl text-white uppercase">Ash</h3>
<div class="w-10 h-[2px] bg-secondary mt-2"></div>
</div>
<div class="space-y-4">
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-on-primary-container uppercase tracking-widest">Densidad</span>
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-white text-sm">670 kg/m³</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-on-primary-container uppercase tracking-widest">Origen</span>
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-white text-sm">Temperate Europe</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-on-primary-container uppercase tracking-widest">Uso</span>
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-white text-sm">Bending / Tools</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-primary uppercase tracking-tighter opacity-100 group-hover:opacity-0">04 / FRESNO</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Product Lines: Macro Focus -->
<section class="bg-primary py-24 px-10">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
<!-- Kitchens -->
<div class="group">
<div class="overflow-hidden border border-white/10">
<img alt="Kitchen Joint" class="w-full aspect-[4/5] object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" data-alt="Macro photograph of a perfect dovetail joint in a modern oak kitchen drawer, showing the precision of the cut and minimal gap" src="/images/stitch/stitch_12.jpg"/>
</div>
<div class="mt-6 flex justify-between items-start">
<div>
<h3 class="font-cabinet font-black text-3xl text-white uppercase tracking-tighter">Kitchens</h3>
<div class="mt-2 flex gap-2">
<span class="border border-white/20 px-2 py-0.5 font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[9px] text-on-primary-container uppercase tracking-widest">Seamless Flow</span>
<span class="border border-white/20 px-2 py-0.5 font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[9px] text-on-primary-container uppercase tracking-widest">Nano-Coated</span>
</div>
</div>
<button class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-4xl" data-icon="arrow_outward">arrow_outward</button>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Closets -->
<div class="group">
<div class="overflow-hidden border border-white/10">
<img alt="Closet Detail" class="w-full aspect-[4/5] object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" data-alt="Detailed close up of an integrated walnut closet handle milled directly into the wood panel, sculptural and minimalist" src="/images/stitch/stitch_13.jpg"/>
</div>
<div class="mt-6 flex justify-between items-start">
<div>
<h3 class="font-cabinet font-black text-3xl text-white uppercase tracking-tighter">Closets</h3>
<div class="mt-2 flex gap-2">
<span class="border border-white/20 px-2 py-0.5 font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[9px] text-on-primary-container uppercase tracking-widest">Integrated Hardware</span>
<span class="border border-white/20 px-2 py-0.5 font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[9px] text-on-primary-container uppercase tracking-widest">Custom Linings</span>
</div>
</div>
<button class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-4xl" data-icon="arrow_outward">arrow_outward</button>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Doors -->
<div class="group">
<div class="overflow-hidden border border-white/10">
<img alt="Door Acabado" class="w-full aspect-[4/5] object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" data-alt="High precision hinge detail on a massive solid oak pivot door, technical and industrial feel with metallic accents" src="/images/stitch/stitch_14.jpg"/>
</div>
<div class="mt-6 flex justify-between items-start">
<div>
<h3 class="font-cabinet font-black text-3xl text-white uppercase tracking-tighter">Doors</h3>
<div class="mt-2 flex gap-2">
<span class="border border-white/20 px-2 py-0.5 font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[9px] text-on-primary-container uppercase tracking-widest">Pivot Core</span>
<span class="border border-white/20 px-2 py-0.5 font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[9px] text-on-primary-container uppercase tracking-widest">Sound Shield</span>
</div>
</div>
<button class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-4xl" data-icon="arrow_outward">arrow_outward</button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Technical Especificaciones / Drafting Section -->
<section class="py-24 px-10 bg-surface flex flex-col items-center">
<div class="w-full max-w-5xl border border-surface-dim p-12 bg-white flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-16 relative overflow-hidden">
<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-10">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-9xl font-cabinet" data-icon="grid_4x4">grid_4x4</span>
</div>
<div class="flex-1 relative z-10">
<h4 class="font-cabinet font-black text-4xl uppercase tracking-tighter leading-none mb-6">Built to<br/>Threshold</h4>
<ul class="space-y-6">
<li class="flex items-start gap-4">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-secondary font-bold">01</span>
<div>
<p class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-primary">Tolerance Rating</p>
<p class="text-sm font-satoshi text-outline mt-1">Sustained 0.1mm variance across all milling axes for perfect joinery.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-4">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-secondary font-bold">02</span>
<div>
<p class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-primary">Humedad Lock</p>
<p class="text-sm font-satoshi text-outline mt-1">Kiln dried to an 8% core equilibrium to prevent tectonic shifting.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-4">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-secondary font-bold">03</span>
<div>
<p class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-primary">Acabado Profile</p>
<p class="text-sm font-satoshi text-outline mt-1">Multi-stage abrasive process reaching 1200 grit before oil application.</p>
</div>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="flex-1 bg-surface-container-low p-8 border-l-4 border-secondary">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.5em] text-outline mb-4 block">Request Datasheet</span>
<form class="space-y-6">
<div>
<label class="block font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] uppercase text-primary mb-1">Project Code</label>
<input class="w-full bg-transparent border-b border-outline focus:border-secondary transition-colors outline-none py-2 font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs uppercase text-sm" placeholder="VY-000-00" type="text"/>
</div>
<div>
<label class="block font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] uppercase text-primary mb-1">Email Terminal</label>
<input class="w-full bg-transparent border-b border-outline focus:border-secondary transition-colors outline-none py-2 font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs uppercase text-sm" placeholder="ARCHITECT@FIRM.COM" type="email"/>
</div>
<button class="w-full bg-primary text-white py-4 font-cabinet font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-xs hover:bg-secondary transition-colors">Generate Specification</button>
</form>
</div>
</div>
</section>

  </main>
</Layout>
